<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonian</para>
  <para style="toc1">TESALONIAN vdwa Paul gv Siti Lvnyinvbv jinam</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonian</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tes</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIAN</para>
  <para style="mt2">vdwa Paul gv Siti Lvnyinvbv Jinam</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">Tesalonika gvrja lo mvngjwngnv vdwv Kristo gv aakur kunam ha dvmin lakula kaayala doonam lvkwng ngv mingominpenla minyakunam mv adwkakubv ribwng toku. <char style="bk">Paul gv Tesalonian vdwa siti jidvnam</char> si Ahtu gv aadw alu hv aaro pvku vla minam go. Paul um sibv minbwk jitoku, Kristo gv aatv madvbv alvmanv okv achialvbv alvmabv rigvnv “Alvmaya choknv” vla minam gvlokv, hv Kristonyi rinyingriru riku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Apostol Paul so puririnv vdwa dinchinv gaam vkv minpa jidu, adwkaku okv hirukaya nga mvngnga gvrila mvngjwng yanga haatin yala Paul la okv ninyigv lvkobv kudungkua ribam vdwgv rinam apiabv turnam lvgabv kudungkua rila doolakv vtoku.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Mimtamchonam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hartv okv ayumnam gaam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo gv aakur kuse gv lvkwng nga minam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristan ridungsvngdung nga tamsarnam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Minyakunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Nyim 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Paul, Sailas okv Timoti gvlokv—Tesalonika gv gvrja gv nyi yvvbunudw Abu Pwknvyarnv okv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gvbvrinv vdwa jidunv:<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Pwknvyarnv Abu okv Ahtu Jisu Kristo nonua aya okv sarsopoyo nga jigv nyika.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristo gv aarilo jwngkadakanam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Ngonugv ajin vdwa, ngonu nonugv lvgabv Pwknvyarnvnyi dw mvnwnglo umbonyikv vdubv rirung dunv. So si ngonugv vbvridubv alvnv dw vku, ogulvgavbolo nonunogv mvngjwng ngv achialvbv kaiyaya duku okv nonuno akin-akinhv kvvbi am paknam rinam gvnam hvka kaiyaya duku. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Vkvlvgabv ngonu atubongv Pwknvyarnv gv gvrja vdwlo ngonu goosu dunv. Ngonu nonunogv mvritmvka okv hirukaya mvnwngnga saktv sula okv mvngjwng bvngla rikunama ngonu goosu dunv. <verse eid="2TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Svbvrinam mvnwng sokv gaklin duku Pwknvyarnv gv jwngkadaka ngv jvjv duku, vbvrinam lokv kaapa duku nonugv hirukaya hinla rinam hv nonu Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo aala dukubv riduku. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Jvjv ngv ogu vdw um Pwknvyarnv rire: nonua hirukaya monv nga hv bunua hirukaya naalwk jire. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Okv hv nonu ngonua hirukaya kunvnga saknu nama jireku, vdwlo Jisu nwgv kairungnv nyidogindung nga lvkobv nyidomooku tolo daklin rikudw hv so vdw sum rireku, <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>okv hv vmv nga gudor dukubv bvngla ikula Pwknvyarnvnyi toa kunv vdwa okv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv lvkwngbv Alvnv Yunying nga tvvmanv vdwa mvrit dukubv rireku. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Aij 2:10</ref></char></note> Bunua hirukaya himbwng jikulo mvrit riku, okv Ahtu gv nvchi okv kairungnv gwlwk lokv adu moreku, <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Vdwlo nwgv nyi vdwa naarwk tvbv ho Alu lo aarikudw ninyi mvngjwngnv nyi mvnwng lokv hartvnama okv mvngdv nama paareku. Ho nonuka reming gvvre, ogulvgavbolo nonu ngonugv minji kunam doin am jvjv ngv vla mvngjwng toku. <verse eid="2TH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Vkvlvgabv ngonu lokia nonugv lvgabv kumdunv. Ngonugv Pwknvyarnv gv nonua singlakv vla goknam lo singla dubv rimutvka vla ngonu ninyia koodunv. Nonugv alvnam gv lvgabv mvngnam ha hv richi molaka okv nonugv mvngjwngla kudungkua rinam ha rinya molaka. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Vbvrila Ahtu Jisu gv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngonugv Pwnvyarnv okv Ahtu gv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngonugv Pwnvyarnv okv Ahtu</char></note> aminv nonu gvlo hartvnama paadubv okv nonu ninyi gvlokv paadubv, ngonugv Pwknvyarnv gvla okv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv aya lokv.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Alvmanv Angv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Tes 4:15-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ngonugv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv aakur kuse gv lvkwng nga okv ngonugv ninyia lvkobv doopam pamse nga minrinyi: ngoogv ajin vdwa ngo nonua koodwkrwkla mindunv, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>nonugv mvngnamlo mvngpumvngpa bv mvngbwkgolo manv gubv riyoka vmalo Ahtu gv Alu hv looro pvku vla mvngru mabvka. So si mvngka kunamv vbvka ripvnvpv nyikrw kaarilo vmalo japkar rilo minpvnvpv vmalo ngonu siti loka lvkpvnv vla kvvbi gunv minpvnvpv. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Nonuno yvvnyika kupku yoka. Vdwlo ataranyabv Nyiru rumisinamv rilin maredw okv Alvmanv Angv uyumooku bolo dooji kunv angv daklwk maredw ho Alu hv loomare. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Eje 28:2</ref></char></note>Hv pwknvyarnv gubv rinv mvnwngnga vmalo kumnamjonam dvdv nga rikin reku okv atu hv ho mvnwngnga kaiyanv gubv minsureku. Hv Pwknvyarnv gv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vnglwkla okv doolwkdula okv Pwknvyarnv gubv minsure.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Nonuno mvngpa malare? Ngo nonua lvkobv doorilo so mvnwng sum nonua minpa jipv kunv. <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Rigvrila vjak sum rilin moma dubv rinv vkv doodu, okv si ogu vdw um nonuno chindu. Vbvrikunamv ridw lo Alvmanv Angv daklwk reku. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Chinyumanam Alvmanv gv jwkrw hv kudungkua nga rirapla ridungduku. Vbvritola ogugo ritv dukudw hv rikumare, okv um lamtv loka naalinla naa ma dvdvlobv. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Aij 11:4</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv Alvmanv Angv daklwk reku, vbvritola vdwlo Ahtu Jisu aari kudw ninyigv gaam gv saknam lokv ninyia sakki reku okv ninyigv loung unglit lokv ninyia ungyak reku. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mt 24:24</ref></char></note>Alvmanv Angv Uyu gv jwkrw nga lvkobv aagvlai kula mvvnamrunam bv nvgwngnv lamrwpanam okv kaasartabobv rila kaatam reku, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>okv ngeji kunv nyi vdwa nvgwngnv kupnv nvnv rinvla kupre. Bunu nyereku ogulvgavbolo bunu Ringjikunv jvjv nga alvbv torwk sima. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv bunu gvlo mvvnam gv jwkrw nga jilula bunua mvvnam ha mvngjwng motoku. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Vbvrinam gv anyung ngv mvnwngngv yvvbunudw jvjv nga mvngjwng manv, vbvritola rimurlo himpu pumin karnv vdwa ngoomu dukubv ritoku.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Ahtu gv paknam ajin vdwa, ngonu nonugv lvgabv Pwknvyarnvnyi alu gv dwkia umbonyikv vrung sego ogulvgavbolo nonugv jvjv nga mvngjwng lokv Pwknvyarnv nonua Dow gv jwkrw lokv ninyigv darwknv nyi bv mvnam lvgabv ringlin kunamlo nonua <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">atukchongv aingbv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">atuake gv lokv</char></note>darcho linpv kunv. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Ngonugv nonua Alvnv Yunying japji kolokv Pwknvyarnv nonua gokpv kunv; Pwknvyarnv nonua goknam mv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv yunglinamlo nonugv baag ka paamu dubv vla goktoku. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Vkvlvgabv ngonugv ajin vdwa nonuno ngonugv japjila okv siti bv lvkla rinam ho gv jvjv lo bikubiv mabv gakbwngla doonya laka.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Ngonugv Ahtu Jisu Kristo atubongv okv ngonugv Pwknvyarnv Abu, ngonua paknv okv ninyigv ayalo ngonua mvngrw ha jibwngnv okv biv manv mvngtin ha jinv, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>nonua mintvmirula alu gv dwkia alvnv ogu vdw um mindu ridubv gwlwk a jilaka.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ngonugv lvgabv Kumlaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Ataranyabv, ngonugv ajin vdwa, ngonugv lvgabv kumlaka, Ahtu gv doinv nonugv hoka rinam apiabv baapubv dusik kardubv okv nyi vdwv doin ha mvngdvla naarwksinam lvgabv. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Okv ngonua Pwknvyarnv alvmanv nyi loka ringya dubv kumji talaka; ogulvgavbolo doin ha tvvnv nyi dvdv ngv mvngjwng dunv vnam kaama.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Vbvritola Ahtu mvngtin dubv rinv ngv, okv nw nonua Alvmanv Angv loka ringyare okv mvngrw dubv mvre. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Okv Ahtu ngonua jidu nonua mvngtin dubv, okv ngonu nonua ogugo mindudw um nonu ridungdo okv ribwngre vla ngonu nonua mvngtin dunv.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Ahtu nonua rigvdakgvla Pwknvyarnv gv paknam ha okv Kristo gv saktv jinam ha kaiyayabv chindubv jigv nyika.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kudungkua Rirung svngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Ngonugv ajin vdwa, ngonu nonua Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv amin lokv mindunv nonuno vkvnv ajin vdwa adu silaka yvvbunudw sepelakrela okv ngonugv minam ha tvvla rimanv vdwa. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Nonuno atubongv alvbv chinsudo ngonu ogugo ripvdw um nonu riming gvvrung svngv. Ngonu nonua lvkobv rirelo ngonu sepelakre matoku. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Ngonu arv jimabv yvv gvka ridur ha anyubv naarwk simato. Vmabvya ngonu atubongv raaibv kudungkua nga gvlwkbv rise nga risuto; ogulvgavbolo ngonu nonua yvvnyika ngonugv lvgabv dormu nwngma mvngla kudungkua nga aluayu bv risuto. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Ngonugv vbvrinamv ngonu nonua ridur go koonyu rinyu manamgo doola ripvnv vnam kaama; ngonugv vbvrinamv nonua kaagvla riming gvmu dubv vla ripvnv. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Ngonugv nonua lvkobv doorilo, ngonu nonua vbv minkito, “Yvvdw kudungkua riji makv vdunv um dvnam dvmu yoka.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Ngonu vbv minto ogulvgavbolo nonugv ara lo nyi mego sepelakrela oguguka rimabv dominla kvvbinyi vdwgv korvpachu riku lo mingominpin riala ridu vla ngonu tvvpado. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv amin lokv ngonu so nyi vdwa dinda bv singla atubogv singdung lvgabv pwla paala relaka vla mindunv.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Vbvritola ajin vdwa nonuno alvnv kudungkua rikulo agarapi rungyoka. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Ngonugv nonua siti jinam so gv doin a akonv tvvmabv rinv ngv doi nvpv. Vbvrinv go dobolo, ninyia oguguka ribamdakbam yoka kaagapla kaapv laka, vkvlvgavbolo ninyia hinying modubv. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Vbvritola ninyia nyirunv aingbv riyo miyoka; vmabvya ajinamin bv gamrw yalaka.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minyabv minam gamchar vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Ahtu atubongv, ngonugv sarsopoyo gv lvtwngbv rinv, dw mvnwnglo okv lamtv mvnwnglo nonua sarsopoyo nga jigv nyika. Ahtu nonu mvnwngnga lvkobv dooming gvlaka.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Ngo atubogv laak lo sum lvkdunv: Paul lokv kumrwknama jidunv, svbv ngo lvknam ha ngo svbv dvdvbv lvkdunv.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv aya ngv nonu mvnwnglo dooming gvlaka.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
